*Workspace*

# General
*.log
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Node
node_modules/

# Plugins (installed by skill system)
plugins/

# Task board (sprint tracking, not version-controlled)
# Only .gitkeep files are tracked — content files are ephemeral per-session
tasks/*/*
!tasks/*/.gitkeep

# Contract runtime state — session/<branch>/contract.json for per-session envelopes
# contract/ itself contains only committed definitions

# Template artifacts (goods-price-comparison ported files)
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Internal workflow artifacts — analysis docs, release plans (not for public repo)
doc/analysis/
doc/releases/
opencode.*.json
opencode.json
